We'll look at it from three angles.

29
00:00:59,007 --> 00:01:00,287
First, the numbers:

30
00:01:00,287 --> 00:01:02,914
the eight main ways card companies earn

31
00:01:02,914 --> 00:01:05,204
money, and how much each one costs

