852
00:26:35,974 --> 00:26:36,647
and dining.

853
00:26:36,827 --> 00:26:37,675
Is it worth it?

854
00:26:37,855 --> 00:26:40,223
It depends entirely on how you live.

855
00:26:40,573 --> 00:26:42,676
If you travel several times a year,

856
00:26:42,676 --> 00:26:44,778
use the full travel credit on trips

857
00:26:44,778 --> 00:26:45,859
you'd take anyway,

858
00:26:45,859 --> 00:26:47,120
and value the lounge,

859
00:26:47,120 --> 00:26:48,201
the math can work.

